{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/4208","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/4208/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/4208/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/4208/events","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/4208","id":1168655193,"node_id":"I_kwDODf6-U85FqENZ","number":4208,"title":"`.just_released()` is `true` on every frame `.release()` is called instead of just the first.","user":{"login":"cdbfoster","id":1524288,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjQyODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1524288?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdbfoster","html_url":"https://github.com/cdbfoster","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdbfoster/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdbfoster/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdbfoster/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdbfoster/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdbfoster/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdbfoster/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdbfoster/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdbfoster/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdbfoster/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1795619323,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzk1NjE5MzIz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/labels/C-Bug","name":"C-Bug","color":"d73a4a","default":false,"description":"An unexpected or incorrect behavior"},{"id":2272055247,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjcyMDU1MjQ3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/labels/A-Input","name":"A-Input","color":"C6A751","default":false,"description":"Player input via keyboard, mouse, gamepad, and more"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2022-03-14T16:57:24Z","updated_at":"2022-03-20T22:12:11Z","closed_at":"2022-03-20T22:12:11Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bevy version\r\n\r\n0.6.1\r\n\r\n## What you did\r\n\r\nCalling `.release()` on an `Input<T>` multiple frames in a row causes `.just_released()` to be true each frame.  This is in opposition to calling `.press()` on that same input multiple frames in a row, which causes `.just_pressed()` to be true only on the first frame.\r\n\r\nThis appears to be because `.press()` checks the `.pressed` set before insertion into the `.just_pressed` set, whereas `.release()` does not.\r\n\r\n## What you expected to happen\r\n\r\nI expected `.just_released()` to return true on only the first frame, like `.just_pressed()`.\r\n\r\n## Other thoughts\r\n\r\nIs there a reason for this behavior that I'm missing?  If so, it's a bit of a gotcha, and should be documented, at least.  If not, it should be a very simple fix to bring the `.release()` behavior in line with `.press()`.  I'd be happy to submit a PR if that's the case.","closed_by":{"login":"bors[bot]","id":26634292,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90MjY2MzQyOTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/bors","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github